                    "description": "KPop Demon Hunters is the official soundtrack to the hit Netflix film and follows Rumi, Mira, and Zoey as they sing and save the day. Featuring massive tracks, including  \"How It’s Done\", \"Golden\", \"Soda Pop\", \"Your Idol\" and the rousing finale \"What It Sounds Like\". The songs move from stadium sized anthems to quiet moments, so kids can dance along, sing along, or just listen and imagine being part of the HUNTR/X team.\n",
